needs a token scope `udb:<service>:<method>`
(or an admin scope) — see *Surface 2*. Many services **degrade to
`FAILED_PRECONDITION "native service '<x>' is disabled"`** when their backend
isn't configured (not an auth failure — a capability gap). Master switch
`UDB_NATIVE_SERVICES_ENABLED`; per-service `UDB_NATIVE_<SERVICE>_ENABLED`.

