## How do I…? (task cookbook)

- **…turn a tenant code into the canonical UUID from code?** Call
  `TenantService.EnsureTenant{code}` — it returns the UUID (resolve-or-create).
- **…find every RPC and its required scope?** `docs/generated/authn-authz-rpc-inventory.md`,
  or `udb sdk manifest` / `udb native docs`.
- **…know a message_type is spelled right?** `udb sdk manifest` lists every FQN.
- **…insert a row?** `Upsert` with **no** `conflict_fields` (append on a
  DB-assigned PK) + `return_record:true` for the assigned id.
- **…make an idempotent write?** Set a stable `idempotency_key` (and
  `conflict_fields` for merge). A replay returns `was_duplicate=true`.
- **…grant a new entity to an existing app?** Add one `policy_rules` row per
  action (or `action:*`) for your role + object=FQN, tenant=UUID. `udb auth
  policy put …` / `PutAuthzPolicy` — or `udb authz seed --entity <fqn>` to
  narrow an existing seeded role.
- **…grant a service access?** Add the scope to its `ServiceAccountGrant`
  (native) AND bind it to your data role (`AssignRole`).
- **…rotate a token/key without downtime?** `set_credentials()` /
  `SetAuthorization` / `SetAPIKey` — hot-swap, no channel rebuild.
- **…read my own write immediately?** Attach the write receipt as a fence:
  `select(..., metadata.afterWrite(resp.write_receipt))`.
- **…add a column?** Add a nullable/`default_value` field with the next free
  field number; `udb plan` shows the additive migration; serve applies it.
- **…delete a field safely?** Remove it and `reserved <number>; reserved "name";`
  — never reuse a number.
- **…preview a schema change?** `udb plan` (diff+gates), `udb drift` (vs live DB),
  `udb proto fmt --check`, `udb compat-matrix`.
- **…debug "permission denied"?** Run the decision tree; or
  `udb doctor --consumer --key <k> --entity <fqn>` for the exact reason.
- **…bypass authz in dev?** `UDB_ABAC_DEFAULT_ALLOW=true` — but only while
  `policy_rules` is empty.
- **…raise a rate limit?** `UDB_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_PER_WINDOW` /
  `UDB_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_SECS` on the broker (or `UDB_RATE_LIMIT_PER_KEY=true` +
  per-key column).
- **…call a native service the SDK has no facade for?** Generated stub over the
  auth channel: `<svc>v1.New<Svc>ServiceClient(nativeConn)` +
  `NativeContext(ctx)`.
- **…subscribe to changes?** `PublishCDC` stream (tenant-scoped, resumable via
  `since_event_id`) or Kafka topic `udb.<svc>.<entity>.<verb>.v1`.
- **…run everything locally?** `udb dev up` (bundled compose) from a repo
  checkout; `udb dev smoke` to sanity-check.

